[h2]当前内容范围[/h2]
适配 HOI4 1.20。本包包含5,815个贴图绑定，较上一公开包净增236；按DLC路径优先级选用5,633个人物来源及5个非人物原图例外。全量已安装库存共5,888个独立来源，其中5,883个人物来源通过美术审查，另5个非人物来源保留原字节，不计AI人物完成。游戏贴图逐项使用自己的原版尺寸，高清母版与修订记录完整归档。

按本项目发布范围，安装包排除中国共产党及其相关势力的替换素材，不扩大到外国共产党势力；安装包发布前已额外审计排除范围。440条未解析引用仍如实记录，实机仅限上方所列位置。请将本模组与替换相同资源的其他头像模组分开测试。

[hr][/hr]
[h2]A little kindness in a strategy game[/h2]
[b]A character portrait mod for Hearts of Iron IV, with individual clothing, hair and poses preserved.[/b]

Hearts of Nailong gradually replaces real-person portraits that may carry real-world controversy with the friendly, harmless Nailong mascot. Clothing, hair, facial hair, poses and other visible details help each character retain an individual appearance.

This is a small creative wish for peace: oppose racial discrimination, respect human dignity, and keep differences of nationality, ethnicity and history from turning into hostility between players. We hope people from different backgrounds can share a laugh and enjoy a strategy game together. Cute portraits cannot solve real conflicts, but they can remind us to treat one another with kindness.

[h2]Keep fiction and reality distinct[/h2]
Countries, wars, characters and alternate paths in the game belong to its fictional experience. Gameplay choices and victories do not justify discrimination, hatred or the glorification of real harm. Please maintain a clear boundary between play and reality, respect fellow players, and avoid projecting fictional rivalries onto real communities.

[h2]Actual gameplay and current scope[/h2]
The images above are genuine HOI4 1.20 country-selection screenshots, not AI-generated gameplay scenes. Limited checks show seven major-country cards plus Romania/Gheorghe Tătărescu and Philippines/Manuel Quezon. They do not certify every character, advisor, event or DLC combination.

This package contains 5,815 texture bindings, 236 more than the previous public package. DLC path precedence selects 5,633 distinct character sources and five byte-preserved non-person sources. The full installed inventory has 5,888 unique sources: 5,883 art-approved characters and five preserved originals, with no AI credit for the non-person exceptions. Each texture uses its own original source dimensions; full-size generated originals and revision records are archived unchanged.

Chinese CCP-related replacement assets are archive-only and excluded from this install payload. The scope does not extend to foreign communist factions. An extra audit confirmed the package follows this exclusion scope. 440 unresolved references remain documented. Other portrait mods may replace the same files; test this mod on its own first.
